, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -5pt; text-align: center;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt;\">2022학년도 2</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt;\">학기 대학원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt;\">일반</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt;\">산업</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt;\">교육 및 컨설팅</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt;\">)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 18pt; font-weight: bold;\">수강신청 안내</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 12pt;\">수강신청은 학생의 성적처리 및 졸업에 관련되는 중요한 사항이므로 수업시간표</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 12pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 12pt;\">수강신청 안내자료 등을 충분히 숙지하여 수강신청 하시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">&nbsp;※&nbsp;</span><u><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">본인의 수강신청 소홀 및 대리수강신청 등으로 인하여 불이익을 당하는 일이 없도록 꼭 유의하시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">.</span></u></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -22.8pt; font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 114, 0);\">(</span><span style=\"text-indent: -22.8pt; font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 114, 0);\">논문과정생들은 논문연구 과목 이수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -22.8pt; font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 114, 0);\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -22.8pt; font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 114, 0);\">산업대학원생은&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -22.8pt; font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 114, 0);\">“</span><span style=\"text-indent: -22.8pt; font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 114, 0);\">공통기초</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -22.8pt; font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 114, 0);\">”&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -22.8pt; font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 114, 0);\">과목 수강신청이 누락되지 않도록 유의하여 주시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -22.8pt; font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 114, 0);\">.)</span></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"7106\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"></div><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">&nbsp;※</span><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\"><u>2022학년도 1학기부터 일반대학원 비전일제 학생&nbsp;</u></span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><u>이수학점 확대 신청 가능(신청방법은 [첨부1] 2022-2학기 수강신청 안내문 참조)</u></span><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: 굴림; font-weight: 700;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; (수강신청 부주의로 인해 해당 학기에 졸업하지 못하는 사례가 종종 발생하고 있습니다. 첨부자료 확인하시고 수강신청 진행하여 주시기 바랍니다.)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><u><br></u></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;- 비전일제 9학점 이수 신청 기간: 2022. 8. 10.(수), 11:00부터 ~ 8. 12.(금), 18:00까지(주임교수님에게 승인받아야함) / [붙임1] 문서 필독</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">&nbsp; &nbsp;*&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">신청경로&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">:&nbsp;</span><u><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">학교홈페이지</span></u><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">-&lt;</span></u><u><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">배너모음</span></u><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">&gt;-</span></u><u><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">대</span></u><u><span style=\"font-fami